@startuml
title Lifecycle of a CIP-113 programmable token
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
  ArrowColor #4A78B5
}

[*] --> ProtocolDeployed
ProtocolDeployed : one-shot params NFT minted
ProtocolDeployed : registry origin node created
ProtocolDeployed : delegate credentials written to the coordination datum

ProtocolDeployed --> Registered : registry_mint inserts a node\nafter the covering node
Registered : policy id bound to the issuance credential\nby blake2b_224 template reconstruction
Registered : transfer, third-party and unfracking\ncredentials declared

Registered --> Circulating : issuance_mint mints into the PLB
Circulating : transfers gated by transfer_logic_script
Circulating : seizure available via third_party
Circulating : unfracking available if the hook is set

Circulating --> Circulating : transfer
Circulating --> Circulating : third-party action
Circulating --> Circulating : unfracking
Circulating --> Registered : burn, separate transaction\nfrom any registry lifecycle change

Registered --> Registered : in-place node update\nby the issuance credential
note right of Registered
  key, next and minting_logic_script
  are frozen. There is no
  de-registration path.
end note
@enduml
